  "scope": "Paired simulator training experiments over recommendation, suppression, bounded coupon and optional replenishment invitations. One customer action changes; other decisions follow the incumbent. Models receive observed features, per-customer28-day retained retail contribution advantages and auxiliary global outcomes. No new economic dynamics, oracle access at inference, native payments or model API calls. Active mandates are never overwritten; replenishment invitations use previously purchased consumables at at most110% of their observed prior payment.",
